{"id":"espantoso","lemma":"espantoso","pos":"adj","rank":3306,"glosses":["ghastly, gruesome, dreadful, awful, godawful, horrific, horrendous, horrible, terrible","frightful, frightening, scary, fearful, terrifying, shocking","hideous, appalling, atrocious, horrid"],"ipa":"/espanˈtoso/","forms":{"feminine":"espantosa","masculinePlural":"espantosos","femininePlural":"espantosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-espantoso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Éste es un trato espantoso.","en":"This is a terrible deal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540728","words":[{"g":"this one"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"treatment"},null]},{"text":"Eso es una posibilidad espantosa.","en":"That's a frightening possibility.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598537","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"possibility"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"El olor era espantoso.","en":"The smell was horrible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77975","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"smell, scent, odor"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Ahí solía vivir un monstruo espantoso.","en":"A hideous monster used to live there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687774","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"monster"},null]},{"text":"Hace un calor espantoso esta mañana.","en":"It is terribly hot this morning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703690","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"heat"},null,{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"tomorrow"}]}]}